                        "glosses": [
                            "A fair-sized piece or amount; a chunk (of anything, especially meat or other food)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Scotland",
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87d3e43f-9513-45a1-bf19-e2086ef8ce21",
                                "sense_id": "91f71f57-7ddb-307d-be8d-21829be832e8",
                                "text": "Whare ancient poets us'd to dine / On junts o' rhymin skill; / Ye might to latest ages shine, An' countless pages fill,[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45966fa7-10bc-4dd6-975d-98a11aecd588",
                                "sense_id": "91f71f57-7ddb-307d-be8d-21829be832e8",
                                "text": "When they were partin with Lady Killdun, she called Ned Burke aside, an (as Donald said) gave him a junt of butter betwixt two fardles of bread, which Ned put into a wallet they had for carrying some little baggage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a63ca94-c7ee-4cad-8b34-625dbf321245",
                                "sense_id": "91f71f57-7ddb-307d-be8d-21829be832e8",
                                "text": "She helped her mother now and then to junts of salt meat out of her master's barrel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93bab245-c7e1-42b9-a285-01168cd1cc8b",
                                "sense_id": "91f71f57-7ddb-307d-be8d-21829be832e8",
                                "text": "\"Throw a couple of turf and a junt of fir on the fire, Dinny, a thaisge, afore ye sit down,\" he said."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "46b19f11-b32c-49ad-bfbc-9c52114f8947",
                                "sense_id": "91f71f57-7ddb-307d-be8d-21829be832e8",
                                "text": "A fine bowl of tea and a junt of flour bread."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0f8a6b31-2814-3b94-b0c2-e351ce72a63e",
                        "entry_id": "40d66ee2-b2e2-3e3a-9d87-ba488b7238c9",
                        "glosses": [
